WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:04.334
-House GOP leader Kevin McCarthy
said he will not cooperate

00:00:04.334 --> 00:00:06.801
with the committee investigating
the January 6th insurrection,

00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:09.667
and one of former
President Trump's key allies

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:11.567
has a new plan
for proving

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:13.267
there was fraud
in the 2020 election

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:16.767
through virtually
the entire population

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:18.167
of the United States in jail,

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:19.634
but It wouldn't
sweat it too much.

00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:23.133
It's not one of the regular
advisers, it's the --

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:26.100
Well, I don't want to give it
away, but he's got one of these.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.868
You think you --

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:29.267
I think you might
know who I'm talking about.

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:30.934
It's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:34.701
♪♪

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.167
Well, this is my last
remote show

00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:38.100
before I head back
to the studio next week

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.634
to be reunited
with the audience,

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:42.133
the crew, and more importantly,
cue card Wally,

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:43.801
who so many of you
have asked about

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:46.901
despite the fact
that he was never sick.

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:49.000
We showed Wally yesterday,
but it was pointed out

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.234
that could have been footage
from any day,

00:00:51.234 --> 00:00:52.334
and to prove he was safe,

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:54.234
he'd need to hold up
a newspaper,

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:55.701
something with
today's date on it.

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:59.167
So Wally, can you hold up
something with today's date?

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:03.801
There you go.

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:05.834
He's totally fine.

00:01:05.834 --> 00:01:07.400
I'm also going to be happy
to get back

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.067
to a place
that has proper snacks,

00:01:09.067 --> 00:01:13.100
as I've been stuck eating this
non-medicinal horse pudding.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:16.200
I got it in my feed store/
corner bodega,

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:20.467
only to find out today
from reading the label

00:01:20.467 --> 00:01:22.434
it's not made from a horse.

00:01:22.434 --> 00:01:24.767
It's made for horses.

00:01:24.767 --> 00:01:25.801
And when you read
something like that,

00:01:25.801 --> 00:01:28.100
you're just [blows raspberry]

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.968
Once again, I'd also like
to thank artist

00:01:29.968 --> 00:01:32.267
Mary LaGarde for the sea captain
and Rihanna painting

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:35.567
that's been keeping me company,
although his interjections

00:01:35.567 --> 00:01:37.267
haven't always been
the most helpful.

00:01:37.267 --> 00:01:40.033
-Sorry, Seth.
I just like to have fun.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.167
-Anyway, in the world
of actual news,

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:43.501
the Republican Party
has decided that

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:46.968
unless you're affirmatively
pro coup, you can't be...

00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:49.601
-♪ A possible candidate ♪

00:01:49.601 --> 00:01:51.667
-Thank you, Rihanna.
She's so wonderful.

00:01:51.667 --> 00:01:52.868
It's actually helpful.

00:01:52.868 --> 00:01:55.934
An interjection
that works as a segue.

00:01:55.934 --> 00:01:58.467
You know, you could learn
something from her, sea captain.

00:01:58.467 --> 00:02:01.000
-Sorry, what?
I-I wasn't listening.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.501
-Alright, moving on
from that painting forever.

00:02:03.501 --> 00:02:06.300
The Republican Party is now
affirmatively pro coup.

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.367
Nothing illustrated
that better than Ted Cruz's

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:09.801
humiliating performance
last week

00:02:09.801 --> 00:02:12.167
where he went on Fox News
to beg forgiveness

00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:13.868
for the grave sin
of calling the insurrection

00:02:13.868 --> 00:02:15.400
a violent terrorist attack,

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.667
an act of self debasement
so pathetic

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:20.133
I thought for a second
he was rushing a fraternity.

00:02:20.133 --> 00:02:21.634
What's he gonna do next,
streak naked

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:23.267
through a committee hearing?

00:02:23.267 --> 00:02:25.734
And the Republican Party
and on right wing media,

00:02:25.734 --> 00:02:27.534
you're simply not allowed
to say anything negative

00:02:27.534 --> 00:02:29.634
about the attempt to
overthrow the 2020 election,

00:02:29.634 --> 00:02:31.467
and you're certainly not allowed
to accept the results.

00:02:31.467 --> 00:02:33.400
Otherwise, Donald Trump
will attack you and call you,

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:36.234
among other things,
a Republican in name only

00:02:36.234 --> 00:02:39.000
as he did during a contentious
NPR interview this week.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.868
-Why did Republican officials in
Arizona accept the results then?

00:02:42.868 --> 00:02:44.734
-Because their rhinos,
and frankly,

00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:46.267
a lot of people
are questioning that.

00:02:46.267 --> 00:02:48.367
-First of all, there's no way
NPR listeners were prepared

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:49.434
for that interview.

00:02:49.434 --> 00:02:51.000
Normally, to hear NPR,
you have to crank

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.901
the volume all the way up
in your car.

00:02:52.901 --> 00:02:55.367
When Trump came on,
it probably set off the airbags

00:02:55.367 --> 00:02:56.834
in every Prius
in the country.

00:02:56.834 --> 00:03:00.200
The streets of Vermont were
littered with coexists stickers

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.400
that got blown off the bumpers.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:04.334
It was like listening
to Terry Gross

00:03:04.334 --> 00:03:06.267
interview a xenomorph
from "Alien."

00:03:06.267 --> 00:03:07.334
-Welcome to "Fresh Air.

00:03:07.334 --> 00:03:08.567
It is such a pleasure
to have you.

00:03:08.567 --> 00:03:11.033
-[Roaring]

00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:14.200
-I want to thank you so much
for talking with us.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.200
Stay safe.
I wish you good health.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.834
But that's what happens
if you're a Republican

00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:20.534
who crosses Trump and accepts
the results of the election.

00:03:20.534 --> 00:03:23.033
You get branded a traitor to the
party and purged from the ranks.

00:03:23.033 --> 00:03:24.567
In order to please Trump
and the base,

00:03:24.567 --> 00:03:26.968
you have to be willing
to go along with insane [bleep]

00:03:26.968 --> 00:03:29.868
like this plan
from MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell

00:03:29.868 --> 00:03:33.567
to, if I'm understanding
this clip correctly,

00:03:33.567 --> 00:03:36.834
imprison almost
everyone in America.

00:03:36.834 --> 00:03:40.133
-I'm more optimistic today
than I have been yesterday,

00:03:40.133 --> 00:03:41.300
the day before that.

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:43.467
I'm inclined like this.
Why?

00:03:43.467 --> 00:03:46.033
Because it's so amazing
all the things that we have.

00:03:46.033 --> 00:03:47.934
We already have all
the pieces of the puzzle.

00:03:47.934 --> 00:03:48.868
And you talked about evidence.

00:03:48.868 --> 00:03:50.501
We had enough evidence

00:03:50.501 --> 00:03:52.934
to put everybody
in prison for life,

00:03:52.934 --> 00:03:55.667
three hundred
and some million people.

00:03:55.667 --> 00:03:57.767
We have that all the way
back to November, December.

00:03:57.767 --> 00:04:02.367
You have enough evidence
to imprison everyone for life?

00:04:02.367 --> 00:04:04.701
I'd love to watch
one of those HBO murder dramas

00:04:04.701 --> 00:04:07.200
starring Nicole Kidman
with Lindell is one

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.501
of the detectives
who just burst into the room

00:04:09.501 --> 00:04:10.801
during an interrogation.

00:04:10.801 --> 00:04:13.534
"Ma'am, where were you
on the night of the murder?"

00:04:13.534 --> 00:04:16.200
"And how many times did you vote
in the election?"

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:17.701
"Not now, Mike."

00:04:17.701 --> 00:04:20.667
"But I have enough proof
to put her in jail for life."

00:04:20.667 --> 00:04:23.267
"For the murder?"
"No, for election stuff.

00:04:23.267 --> 00:04:26.534
And also you and me
and everyone else."

00:04:26.534 --> 00:04:29.367
"What about the charming British
guy with the mysterious past?"

00:04:29.367 --> 00:04:30.901
"[ Laughs ] Oh no, I like him.

00:04:30.901 --> 00:04:37.167
I like him a lot because he was
in the movie with the bear."

00:04:37.167 --> 00:04:41.300
So this is the kind of insanity
that has taken hold of the GOP,

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.234
which is different
than the kind of insanity

00:04:43.234 --> 00:04:48.567
that has taken hold
of me...here.

00:04:48.567 --> 00:04:51.133
Which is why investigating
the coup is so necessary,

00:04:51.133 --> 00:04:52.701
otherwise they'll
just do it again,

00:04:52.701 --> 00:04:54.300
which is also why Republicans
are refusing

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.767
to participate in any way.

00:04:55.767 --> 00:04:56.968
For example,
the committee conducting

00:04:56.968 --> 00:04:58.634
the investigation just asked

00:04:58.634 --> 00:05:00.934
House GOP Leader Kevin McCarthy
for information,

00:05:00.934 --> 00:05:03.000
and McCarthy said
he will not cooperate.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.000
-House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy says

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.334
he will not cooperate
with the January 6th

00:05:07.334 --> 00:05:10.801
select committee after the panel
formally requested an interview

00:05:10.801 --> 00:05:12.701
with the California lawmaker.

00:05:12.701 --> 00:05:15.701
The committee is seeking details
of McCarthy's communications

00:05:15.701 --> 00:05:19.400
with then-President Donald Trump
throughout the Capitol attack

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.300
and in the days that followed.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:24.868
McCarthy's refusal comes despite
his agreeing in May of last year

00:05:24.868 --> 00:05:28.367
to cooperate with any sort
of investigation of the riot.

00:05:28.367 --> 00:05:30.801
-Now, McCarthy says
he will not cooperate,

00:05:30.801 --> 00:05:33.133
despite saying
that he has nothing to hide.

00:05:33.133 --> 00:05:34.868
But GOP Congresswoman
Liz Cheney,

00:05:34.868 --> 00:05:37.467
the committee's vice chairwoman,
will not rule out

00:05:37.467 --> 00:05:40.834
sending McCarthy,
her colleague, a subpoena.

00:05:40.834 --> 00:05:43.000
-No offense, but why are
they asking Kevin McCarthy

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:44.100
for information now?

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:45.267
This committee move slower

00:05:45.267 --> 00:05:47.767
than the courtship
in a Jane Austen novel?

00:05:47.767 --> 00:05:50.400
Did you invite him
via scented letter?

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.067
With that said, I do hope
they subpoena him,

00:05:52.067 --> 00:05:53.534
mainly because
it'd be super funny

00:05:53.534 --> 00:05:55.801
to see him try to hide
from the process server.

00:05:55.801 --> 00:05:57.868
Although I'm guessing
the GOP conference

00:05:57.868 --> 00:06:00.501
any of these guys
could be Kevin McCarthy.

00:06:00.501 --> 00:06:01.667
How could you pick him
out of a crowd?

00:06:01.667 --> 00:06:03.667
Even Trump
doesn't know his name.

00:06:03.667 --> 00:06:06.534
-There was progress today.
I look forward to solving it.

00:06:06.534 --> 00:06:08.667
-Thank you, Steve.
-Can't blame Trump for that one.

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:10.100
He looks like a Steve
to me, too.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.667
If he were a character
in "Guess Who?",

00:06:11.667 --> 00:06:13.300
that [bleep]
would be impossible.

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:14.534
And it would certainly

00:06:14.534 --> 00:06:16.100
be interesting to hear
from McCarthy,

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.667
given that just days
after the insurrection,

00:06:18.667 --> 00:06:20.133
he had this to say about Trump.

00:06:20.133 --> 00:06:22.000
-The president bears
responsibility

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.133
for Wednesday's attack
on Congress by mob rioters.

00:06:25.133 --> 00:06:26.734
-Oh boy, I'm guessing McCarthy
doesn't want

00:06:26.734 --> 00:06:27.934
anyone to remember
that video.

00:06:27.934 --> 00:06:29.968
"No, no, no.
That wasn't me.

00:06:29.968 --> 00:06:32.701
That was that [bleep] Steve.
I hate that guy."

00:06:32.701 --> 00:06:34.834
Of course,
that was just a few weeks

00:06:34.834 --> 00:06:36.801
before McCarthy changed his tune

00:06:36.801 --> 00:06:39.767
and flew down to Mar-a-Lago
to pose for photos with Trump

00:06:39.767 --> 00:06:41.901
like they were
personal injury attorneys

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:43.300
who worked out of the Vatican.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:46.000
Have you been rear ended
by the Popemobile?

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.334
You could be entitled
to compensation.

00:06:48.334 --> 00:06:51.067
Call us at 1-800-1-Pope-Crash.

00:06:51.067 --> 00:06:55.067
The S-H is for, shh,
don't tell nobody.

00:06:55.067 --> 00:06:57.901
And McCarthy certainly seems
to have firsthand knowledge

00:06:57.901 --> 00:07:00.300
of exactly what happened
that day, and in particular,

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:03.100
what Trump is up to,
given that by his own admission,

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:04.400
he spoke directly to Trump.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.334
In fact, during
the second impeachment process,

00:07:06.334 --> 00:07:08.467
a fellow Republican member
of Congress

00:07:08.467 --> 00:07:10.701
relayed part of McCarthy's
conversation with Trump,

00:07:10.701 --> 00:07:13.267
in which Trump expressed
his support for the mob.

00:07:13.267 --> 00:07:15.701
And when McCarthy was asked
about that conversation on TV,

00:07:15.701 --> 00:07:17.067
he just refused to answer.

00:07:17.067 --> 00:07:21.434
-During the Trump impeachment
in February,

00:07:21.434 --> 00:07:23.767
during the trial in the Senate,
a Republican

00:07:23.767 --> 00:07:25.267
congresswoman said this.

00:07:25.267 --> 00:07:27.133
I'm going to to put it up
on the screen.

00:07:27.133 --> 00:07:29.133
She said that while
the January 6th riot

00:07:29.133 --> 00:07:32.100
was in full force,
you phoned President Trump

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.934
and asked him
to call off his supporters.

00:07:33.934 --> 00:07:37.133
And according to you, she said,
the president responded,

00:07:37.133 --> 00:07:39.701
"Well, Kevin, I guess
these people are more upset

00:07:39.701 --> 00:07:42.033
about the election
than you are."

00:07:42.033 --> 00:07:45.067
Is she right? Is that what
President Trump said to you?

00:07:45.067 --> 00:07:46.567
-What I talked to President
Trump about,

00:07:46.567 --> 00:07:48.334
I was the first person
to contact him

00:07:48.334 --> 00:07:49.734
when the riots was going on.

00:07:49.734 --> 00:07:51.067
-But I'm asking you
specifically,

00:07:51.067 --> 00:07:53.868
did he say to you I guess some
people are more concerned

00:07:53.868 --> 00:07:56.100
about the election than you are?

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.334
-No. Listen, my conversations
with the president

00:07:58.334 --> 00:07:59.934
are my conversations
with the president.

00:07:59.934 --> 00:08:02.200
-No wonder he doesn't want
to answer questions under oath.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.868
He isn't even good
at being evasive.

00:08:03.868 --> 00:08:06.200
When you ask these guys simple
straightforward questions

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:07.701
about what happened that day,

00:08:07.701 --> 00:08:10.000
they melt down and
sing meaningless pabulum.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.000
Look, my conversations
with the president

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.567
are words that I spoke
from my mouth

00:08:13.567 --> 00:08:15.601
that were then transmitted
via sound waves

00:08:15.601 --> 00:08:16.634
and received by his ears.

00:08:16.634 --> 00:08:18.400
As you know ears,
there's one,

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:19.667
maybe even two of them
and they're

00:08:19.667 --> 00:08:21.100
on either side of your head,

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.567
the big round thing that can
be found on top of your neck.

00:08:23.567 --> 00:08:25.334
Unless you're Rudy Giuliani,
in which case

00:08:25.334 --> 00:08:27.100
it's attached directly
to your...

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.534
-♪ Chest ♪

00:08:28.534 --> 00:08:30.567
-[ Laughs ] Thank you, Rihanna.

00:08:30.567 --> 00:08:33.033
There have also --
[ Laughs ]

00:08:33.033 --> 00:08:34.667
There have also been reports

00:08:34.667 --> 00:08:36.934
that Trump and McCarthy
got into a shout--

00:08:36.934 --> 00:08:40.200
We're going out on top
with the painting jokes.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:42.133
There have also been reports
that Trump and McCarthy

00:08:42.133 --> 00:08:44.601
got into a shouting match
on that phone call after Trump

00:08:44.601 --> 00:08:46.968
refused to call off the rioters,
which makes sense

00:08:46.968 --> 00:08:49.067
because they were doing
what Trump wanted them to do.

00:08:49.067 --> 00:08:50.434
They were trying
to violently stop

00:08:50.434 --> 00:08:51.834
the counting
of electoral votes,

00:08:51.834 --> 00:08:54.167
which would have allowed Trump
to remain in power.

00:08:54.167 --> 00:08:57.601
Again, it would be great to hear
from McCarthy under oath,

00:08:57.601 --> 00:08:59.033
whether that was true or not.

00:08:59.033 --> 00:09:00.734
Even former Fox News
host Chris Wallace

00:09:00.734 --> 00:09:02.767
seemed to have an inkling
something suspicious

00:09:02.767 --> 00:09:04.467
that happened
between the two of them,

00:09:04.467 --> 00:09:05.968
as evidenced by this exchange

00:09:05.968 --> 00:09:07.467
from later
in that same interview.

00:09:07.467 --> 00:09:10.300
-I want to ask you
a specific question about this,

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:15.767
because there have been and are
continuing to be investigations

00:09:15.767 --> 00:09:17.000
of what happened
on January 6th.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.868
We'll talk about
the commission in a minute.

00:09:18.868 --> 00:09:20.834
Has the president
ever reached out to you

00:09:20.834 --> 00:09:25.133
since that report came out
to discuss what you

00:09:25.133 --> 00:09:27.567
and he talked about
on the January 6th phone call?

00:09:27.567 --> 00:09:29.267
And did you say to him,

00:09:29.267 --> 00:09:31.300
"I can't because
we're under oath?"

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.734
-No.
-That never happened?

00:09:33.734 --> 00:09:34.868
-It's never happened.
-And you --

00:09:34.868 --> 00:09:36.367
-Never even close.

00:09:36.367 --> 00:09:37.601
-And if it did happen,

00:09:37.601 --> 00:09:39.934
you would agree
that would be witness tampering.

00:09:39.934 --> 00:09:41.734
-Yeah, but never happened.
Never even came close.

00:09:41.734 --> 00:09:43.968
Never had
any conversation like that.

00:09:43.968 --> 00:09:46.200
-I will say Wallace
definitely seems to know

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.834
something happened between them.

00:09:47.834 --> 00:09:49.434
He's leaning
into those questions

00:09:49.434 --> 00:09:54.000
the way a parent grills their
teenage son about smoking weed.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.601
"You would never do that,
right?"

00:09:55.601 --> 00:09:57.200
"No, of course not."

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.501
"Because that kind of thing
could get you grounded."

00:09:59.501 --> 00:10:01.701
"Yeah, for sure."

00:10:01.701 --> 00:10:05.167
"And it would make
your clothes smell like weed."

00:10:05.167 --> 00:10:07.534
"Oh...yeah."

00:10:07.534 --> 00:10:12.300
"Like the socks
in your sock drawer."

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:13.801
"Uh-huh.
Wait, it was."

00:10:13.801 --> 00:10:15.567
-I'm not saying Wallace knows
for sure what happened,

00:10:15.567 --> 00:10:17.634
but to me it sounds
like he has...

00:10:17.634 --> 00:10:21.267
-Enough evidence to put
everybody in prison for life,

00:10:21.267 --> 00:10:23.000
Three hundred
and some million people.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:26.367
-Get the energy of a guy
selling autographed

00:10:26.367 --> 00:10:29.000
Pete Rose cards on QVC.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.901
McCarthy won't comply
because he knows

00:10:30.901 --> 00:10:33.501
Republican voters will reward
him for his allegiance to Trump.

00:10:33.501 --> 00:10:36.400
Above all else, it's a movement
that is fully radicalized

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.334
against democracy to the point
where they're calling

00:10:38.334 --> 00:10:40.501
for the imprisonment
of their political enemies,

00:10:40.501 --> 00:10:43.234
which is why the various
investigations underway

00:10:43.234 --> 00:10:44.467
need to do everything possible

00:10:44.467 --> 00:10:46.300
get to the truth
of what happened and fast.

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:49.234
As for us, we'll plan to be back
in our studio next week,

00:10:49.234 --> 00:10:51.734
and hope you've enjoyed
this little week-long

00:10:51.734 --> 00:10:54.100
return to isolation
with horse pudding jokes

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:56.367
and sea captain interjections.

00:10:56.367 --> 00:10:58.968
I haven't checked,
but I have to imagine

00:10:58.968 --> 00:11:00.200
our ratings have been...

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.968
-On an incline
like this.

00:11:01.968 --> 00:11:04.501
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:04.501 --> 00:11:08.434
♪♪

00:11:08.434 --> 00:11:10.100
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings over

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:12.100
two million meals a year
to men, women and children

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:15.067
living with HIV, AIDS, cancer
and other serious illnesses,

00:11:15.067 --> 00:11:16.567
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:11:16.567 --> 00:11:18.734
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the donate button.

00:11:18.734 --> 00:11:21.300
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

